1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,376
50 lakh ka home loan, aur bank ko wapas 95,93,875 rupaye?

2
00:00:06,376 --> 00:00:12,751
Haan, yeh Bank of Baroda ke apne calculator ka hisaab hai.

3
00:00:12,751 --> 00:00:14,490
Matlab lagbhag double.

4
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:17,573
Ghar ek khareeda, par bill lagbhag dugna.

5
00:00:17,573 --> 00:00:20,655
Aur sabse bada jhatka abhi baaki hai.

6
00:00:20,655 --> 00:00:26,380
Shuru ke saalon ki EMI ka zyaadatar hissa ghar mein jaata hi nahi.

7
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:31,332
Yeh kahani hai Bhai ki. Naukri pakki, shaadi ho chuki,

8
00:00:31,332 --> 00:00:36,779
aur sapna ek, apna flat. Bank Uncle ne loan pass kiya,

9
00:00:36,779 --> 00:00:39,750
aur ghar mein mithai baati gayi.

10
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:42,870
Papa ne kandhe par haath rakha aur bole,

11
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:45,210
bas EMI time par bharte rehna,

12
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:48,720
baaki sab apne aap ho jaayega. Sabne maan liya.

13
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,280
Lekin kya sach mein?

14
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:52,017
Kyunki kuch saal baad,

15
00:00:52,017 --> 00:00:56,359
Bhai ne pehli baar apna loan statement dhyaan se khola.

16
00:00:56,359 --> 00:01:00,267
Aur jo dekha, us raat use neend nahi aayi.

17
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:01,570
Kya tha usme?

18
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:03,274
Itni EMI bhar di,

19
00:01:03,274 --> 00:01:07,108
phir bhi bacha hua udhaar lagbhag utna ka utna.

20
00:01:07,108 --> 00:01:10,942
Toh paisa gaya kahaan? Seedha bank ki jeb mein,

21
00:01:10,942 --> 00:01:12,220
byaaj ban kar.

22
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:14,348
Toh aaj teen sawaal. Pehla,

23
00:01:14,348 --> 00:01:19,029
50 lakh ka loan lagbhag double kaise ban jaata hai? Doosra,

24
00:01:19,029 --> 00:01:23,710
pehle saalon mein ghar ka kitna hissa sach mein aapka hua?

25
00:01:23,710 --> 00:01:24,632
Aur teesra,

26
00:01:24,632 --> 00:01:31,548
saal mein sirf ek extra EMI bharne se kitna byaaj aur kitne saal bachte hain?

27
00:01:31,548 --> 00:01:34,775
Teesre jawaab ke liye aakhir tak rukna,

28
00:01:34,775 --> 00:01:37,080
woh sabse kaam ka hai.

29
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:42,110
Par pehle chalte hain wahan, jahan yeh kahani shuru hui thi.

30
00:01:42,110 --> 00:01:43,940
Bank ki counter par,

31
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:48,970
jahan Bhai ne khushi khushi har kaagaz par sign kiya tha.

32
00:01:48,970 --> 00:01:51,525
Bank Uncle ne file kholi. Pehli baat,

33
00:01:51,525 --> 00:01:54,080
ghar ki poori keemat bank nahi deta.

34
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:58,460
Kam se kam 20 percent aapko apni jeb se dena padta hai.

35
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:02,864
Isse margin kehte hain, yaani ghar mein aapka apna hissa.

36
00:02:02,864 --> 00:02:05,066
Baaki sab bank ka udhaar.

37
00:02:05,066 --> 00:02:09,030
Aur asli kahani isi udhaar se shuru hoti hai.

38
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:13,345
Bhai ke papers par likha tha, loan 50 lakh rupaye.

39
00:02:13,345 --> 00:02:16,365
Is asal udhaar ko principal kehte hain.

40
00:02:16,365 --> 00:02:20,680
Yaani woh paisa jo bank ne sach mein aapko diya.

41
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:24,539
Ab bank yeh paisa muft mein toh dega nahi.

42
00:02:24,539 --> 00:02:27,111
Udhaar ka bhi kiraya hota hai.

43
00:02:27,111 --> 00:02:30,970
Usi kiraye ko byaaj kehte hain, angrezi mein interest.

44
00:02:30,970 --> 00:02:34,430
In dono ko milaakar banti hai EMI.

45
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:39,866
EMI yaani har mahine ki fixed kisht. Har mahine wahi raqam,

46
00:02:39,866 --> 00:02:43,820
20 saal tak, bina ek bhi mahina chooke.

47
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:50,205
Ab Bank of Baroda ke calculator mein 50 lakh ka loan daalo.

48
00:02:50,205 --> 00:02:53,397
Akela byaaj aata hai 45,93,875 rupaye.

49
00:02:53,397 --> 00:02:56,590
Yaani lagbhag asal udhaar jitna hi.

50
00:02:56,590 --> 00:03:00,726
Socho zara. Aapne 50 lakh udhaar liye,

51
00:03:00,726 --> 00:03:07,815
aur upar se lagbhag utne hi bank ko kiraye mein de diye.

52
00:03:07,815 --> 00:03:11,360
Total bill ho gaya 95,93,875 rupaye.

53
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:16,370
Par aisa hota kyun hai? Byaaj sirf ek baar nahi lagta.

54
00:03:16,370 --> 00:03:19,102
Har mahine, jitna udhaar bacha hai,

55
00:03:19,102 --> 00:03:22,290
us poore par naya byaaj judta hai.

56
00:03:22,290 --> 00:03:24,781
Ise kiraye ke ghar jaisa samjho.

57
00:03:24,781 --> 00:03:29,348
Jab tak aap usme rehte ho, har mahine kiraya dete ho.

58
00:03:29,348 --> 00:03:33,500
Udhaar bhi waisa hi hai, jitni der rakho, utna kiraya.

59
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:36,126
Aur 20 saal bahut lambi der hai.

60
00:03:36,126 --> 00:03:39,503
Itne saal bank ka paisa aapke paas rehta hai.

61
00:03:39,503 --> 00:03:43,630
Isliye kiraya bhi itna bada ho jaata hai, lagbhag udhaar jitna.

62
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:47,340
Toh kya yeh poora byaaj bank ka munafa hai? Nahi.

63
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:51,050
Bank ko bhi FD waalon ko byaaj dena hota hai,

64
00:03:51,050 --> 00:03:54,760
aur staff aur branch ka kharcha bhi uthana hota hai.

65
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:58,111
Lekin aapki jeb ke liye hisaab seedha hai.

66
00:03:58,111 --> 00:04:02,718
Ghar ka udhaar alag, aur upar se lagbhag utna hi byaaj.

67
00:04:02,718 --> 00:04:05,650
Yahi hai aapke ghar ka asli bill.

68
00:04:05,650 --> 00:04:09,337
Behen ne yeh number dekha toh boli, theek hai,

69
00:04:09,337 --> 00:04:10,565
byaaj zyada hai.

70
00:04:10,565 --> 00:04:16,300
Par har EMI ke saath ghar thoda thoda apna toh hota jaata hai na?

71
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,590
Yahi sabse badi galatfehmi hai.

72
00:04:18,590 --> 00:04:23,628
Shuru ke saalon mein ghar bahut hi dheere apna hota hai.

73
00:04:23,628 --> 00:04:27,750
Kitna dheere? Par asli sawaal ab shuru hota hai.

74
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:28,810
Doosra sawaal.

75
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:34,640
Pehle saalon mein aapki EMI ka kitna hissa ghar mein gaya,

76
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,820
aur kitna bank ki jeb mein?

77
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:41,000
Jawaab ek table mein chhupa hai.

78
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:45,968
Is table ko amortisation schedule kehte hain. Naam mushkil, kaam seedha.

79
00:04:45,968 --> 00:04:50,484
Har EMI mein kitna byaaj gaya, kitna asal udhaar kata,

80
00:04:50,484 --> 00:04:52,290
sab likha hota hai.

81
00:04:52,290 --> 00:04:54,055
Bank yeh table deta hai,

82
00:04:54,055 --> 00:04:56,526
aksar app mein bhi mil jaata hai.

83
00:04:56,526 --> 00:04:59,349
Par zyaadatar log ise kabhi kholte hi nahi.

84
00:04:59,349 --> 00:05:01,820
Bhai ne bhi kabhi nahi khola tha.

85
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:07,331
Ab Bank of Baroda ka ek 20 saal ka schedule dekho.

86
00:05:07,331 --> 00:05:12,843
Pehle saal poore saal ki EMI bhari gayi, kul 2,28,000 rupaye.

87
00:05:12,843 --> 00:05:16,350
Ab andaaza lagao, isme byaaj kitna tha?

88
00:05:16,350 --> 00:05:18,738
Jawaab hai 1,82,261 rupaye.

89
00:05:18,738 --> 00:05:25,304
Yaani saal bhar ki EMI ka zyaadatar paisa seedha byaaj mein.

90
00:05:25,304 --> 00:05:30,080
Asal udhaar mein toh bahut thoda hi gaya.

91
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:33,550
Matlab poore saal EMI bharne ke baad bhi,

92
00:05:33,550 --> 00:05:35,719
udhaar lagbhag utna ka utna.

93
00:05:35,719 --> 00:05:40,490
Ghar ka bahut chhota sa hissa hi sach mein aapka hua.

94
00:05:40,490 --> 00:05:43,573
Aisa kyun? Shuru mein udhaar sabse bada hota hai.

95
00:05:43,573 --> 00:05:46,657
Toh us par byaaj bhi sabse bada banta hai.

96
00:05:46,657 --> 00:05:49,740
Aur EMI ka bada hissa wahi kha jaata hai.

97
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:53,157
Jaise jaise udhaar ghatta hai, byaaj bhi ghatta hai.

98
00:05:53,157 --> 00:05:57,333
Tab EMI ka zyada hissa asal udhaar mein jaane lagta hai.

99
00:05:57,333 --> 00:05:59,990
Lekin yeh bahut saalon baad hota hai.

100
00:05:59,990 --> 00:06:02,846
Isi ko front-loaded byaaj kehte hain.

101
00:06:02,846 --> 00:06:09,033
Yaani bank apna kiraya shuru ke saalon mein hi zyada vasool karta hai.

102
00:06:09,033 --> 00:06:12,840
Aakhri saalon ki EMI zyaadatar asal chukaati hai.

103
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:16,389
Ab samjhe, Bhai ko neend kyun nahi aayi?

104
00:06:16,389 --> 00:06:19,494
Kuch saal EMI bharne ke baad bhi,

105
00:06:19,494 --> 00:06:23,930
statement mein bacha hua udhaar pahaad jaisa dikh raha tha.

106
00:06:23,930 --> 00:06:25,809
Aur ek khatra bhi tha.

107
00:06:25,809 --> 00:06:28,439
Bhai ka loan floating rate par tha.

108
00:06:28,439 --> 00:06:33,700
Floating rate yaani byaaj RBI ke faislon ke saath upar neeche hota rehta hai.

109
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:37,423
Byaaj badhe, toh bank aksar EMI nahi chhedta.

110
00:06:37,423 --> 00:06:42,543
Chupchaap loan ke saal badha deta hai. Aur lambe saal matlab,

111
00:06:42,543 --> 00:06:44,870
aur zyada mahine ka byaaj.

112
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:48,141
Toh sirf EMI time par bharna kaafi nahi hai.

113
00:06:48,141 --> 00:06:50,685
Papa ki baat aadhi hi sahi thi.

114
00:06:50,685 --> 00:06:54,320
Lekin is jaal se nikalne ka ek seedha raasta hai.

115
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:57,164
Mummy ne chai rakhi aur poocha,

116
00:06:57,164 --> 00:07:02,852
toh kya hum 20 saal tak bas bank ka kiraya bharte rahenge?

117
00:07:02,852 --> 00:07:06,170
Behen muskurayi. Nahi Mummy, ek tareeka hai.

118
00:07:06,170 --> 00:07:09,223
Teesra sawaal, aur sabse kaam ka.

119
00:07:09,223 --> 00:07:13,801
Agar saal mein sirf ek extra EMI bhar do,

120
00:07:13,801 --> 00:07:18,380
toh kya hoga? Jawaab sunkar aap shayad chaunk jaayenge.

121
00:07:18,380 --> 00:07:23,867
Isse prepayment kehte hain. Yaani time se pehle, apni marzi se,

122
00:07:23,867 --> 00:07:26,860
loan mein extra paisa jama karna.

123
00:07:26,860 --> 00:07:31,350
Yeh paisa seedha asal udhaar ko kam karta hai.

124
00:07:31,350 --> 00:07:35,480
Aur yahi iska jaadu hai. Asal udhaar kam hua,

125
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:40,068
toh agle mahine se us par byaaj bhi kam lagega.

126
00:07:40,068 --> 00:07:43,280
Har mahine, loan ke aakhri din tak.

127
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:48,254
The Economic Times ne ek hisaab chhapa. 50 lakh ka loan,

128
00:07:48,254 --> 00:07:50,968
Bhai ke loan se thoda lamba.

129
00:07:50,968 --> 00:07:55,490
Bas saal mein ek extra EMI, aur kuch nahi badla.

130
00:07:55,490 --> 00:08:00,895
Report ke mutabik, byaaj mein lagbhag 18.31 lakh rupaye bache. Socho,

131
00:08:00,895 --> 00:08:06,300
saal mein sirf ek extra kisht, aur lakhon rupaye ki bachat.

132
00:08:06,300 --> 00:08:10,237
Aur loan bhi 5 saal se zyada pehle khatam.

133
00:08:10,237 --> 00:08:12,861
Yaani saalon tak koi EMI nahi.

134
00:08:12,861 --> 00:08:18,110
Woh paisa bachchon ki padhai ya budhape ke kaam aa sakta hai.

135
00:08:18,110 --> 00:08:19,859
Itna bada fark kyun?

136
00:08:19,859 --> 00:08:23,794
Kyunki extra paisa shuru ke saalon mein jaata hai,

137
00:08:23,794 --> 00:08:29,040
jab udhaar sabse bada hai aur byaaj sabse zyada kaat raha hai.

138
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:32,160
Wahi front-loading jo ab tak aapke khilaaf thi,

139
00:08:32,160 --> 00:08:36,060
ab aapke saath kaam karti hai. Jitna jaldi prepay karo,

140
00:08:36,060 --> 00:08:38,010
utna zyada byaaj bachta hai.

141
00:08:38,010 --> 00:08:40,145
Bhai ne Behen se poocha,

142
00:08:40,145 --> 00:08:43,989
par ek extra EMI aayegi kahaan se? Behen boli,

143
00:08:43,989 --> 00:08:45,270
Diwali ka bonus.

144
00:08:45,270 --> 00:08:49,540
Ya har mahine EMI ka thoda thoda hissa alag rakho.

145
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:54,286
Saal ke aakhir tak ek EMI jitna paisa jud jaata hai.

146
00:08:54,286 --> 00:08:57,738
Woh seedha bank mein, prepayment ke naam par.

147
00:08:57,738 --> 00:09:01,190
Bas itna sa kaam, saal mein ek baar.

148
00:09:01,190 --> 00:09:05,393
Par Papa ko darr tha. Bank waale penalty toh nahi lagayenge?

149
00:09:05,393 --> 00:09:09,214
Pehle paisa lautaoge, toh unka byaaj ka nuksaan hoga na?

150
00:09:09,214 --> 00:09:10,360
Sawaal sahi tha.

151
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:14,349
Yahan RBI ka ek saaf niyam aapke kaam aata hai.

152
00:09:14,349 --> 00:09:16,343
Floating rate home loan par,

153
00:09:16,343 --> 00:09:21,130
banks prepayment ya loan jaldi band karne ki penalty nahi le sakte.

154
00:09:21,130 --> 00:09:23,995
Yaani aapka loan floating rate par hai,

155
00:09:23,995 --> 00:09:28,906
toh extra paisa jama karne par bank koi penalty nahi maang sakta.

156
00:09:28,906 --> 00:09:32,180
Yeh aapka haq hai, bank ki meherbaani nahi.

157
00:09:32,180 --> 00:09:36,347
Ek baat dhyaan rakho. Prepay karte waqt bank ko likhkar bolo,

158
00:09:36,347 --> 00:09:39,378
EMI wahi rakho, loan ke saal kam karo.

159
00:09:39,378 --> 00:09:42,030
Byaaj ki zyaadatar bachat isi mein hai.

160
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:47,053
Bhai ne usi hafte bank jaakar pehli extra EMI jama ki.

161
00:09:47,053 --> 00:09:52,077
Statement mein pehli baar udhaar sach mein kam dikha. Par ruko,

162
00:09:52,077 --> 00:09:54,360
ek galti abhi baaki hai.

163
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:58,306
Ab woh galti jo bahut log karte hain. Woh sochte hain,

164
00:09:58,306 --> 00:10:00,817
home loan par tax toh bachta hai,

165
00:10:00,817 --> 00:10:02,970
phir jaldi chukaane ki kya zaroorat?

166
00:10:02,970 --> 00:10:06,442
Haan, tax ka fayda hai. Section 24(b) mein,

167
00:10:06,442 --> 00:10:10,348
apne rehne waale ghar ke loan ke byaaj par,

168
00:10:10,348 --> 00:10:13,820
saal mein 2,00,000 rupaye tak deduction milta hai.

169
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:17,533
Deduction yaani itni income par tax nahi lagta.

170
00:10:17,533 --> 00:10:22,173
Asal udhaar chukaane par Section 80C mein bhi fayda hai,

171
00:10:22,173 --> 00:10:26,350
PPF jaisi cheezon ke saath milaakar 1,50,000 rupaye tak.

172
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:27,364
Par dhyaan do,

173
00:10:27,364 --> 00:10:30,406
yeh dono fayde purane tax system mein milte hain.

174
00:10:30,406 --> 00:10:34,800
Naye tax system mein apne rehne waale ghar par yeh deduction nahi milte.

175
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:37,567
Aur sabse badi baat. Tax mein jo bachta hai,

176
00:10:37,567 --> 00:10:39,720
woh byaaj ka sirf ek hissa hai.

177
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,258
Bank ko diya baaki byaaj,

178
00:10:41,258 --> 00:10:43,410
phir bhi aapki jeb se hi gaya.

179
00:10:43,410 --> 00:10:48,078
Toh aapke liye seedhi baat kya hai? Apna loan statement kholo.

180
00:10:48,078 --> 00:10:51,898
Dekho, is saal ki EMI mein kitna byaaj gaya,

181
00:10:51,898 --> 00:10:54,020
aur kitna asal udhaar kata.

182
00:10:54,020 --> 00:10:57,771
Phir check karo, aapka loan floating rate par hai ya fixed.

183
00:10:57,771 --> 00:11:01,182
Floating hai, toh prepayment par penalty ka sawaal hi nahi.

184
00:11:01,182 --> 00:11:03,910
Shaq ho, toh bank se likhit mein poocho.

185
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:04,293
Haan,

186
00:11:04,293 --> 00:11:08,892
prepay karne se pehle emergency ke liye kuch paisa alag zaroor rakho.

187
00:11:08,892 --> 00:11:12,724
Aur apne CA se tax ka hisaab bhi milaa lo,

188
00:11:12,724 --> 00:11:14,640
khaaskar purana ya naya system.

189
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:16,722
Yeh investment advice nahi hai.

190
00:11:16,722 --> 00:11:19,637
Har ghar ki zaroorat alag hoti hai.

191
00:11:19,637 --> 00:11:22,968
Par ek baat har ghar par lagti hai,

192
00:11:22,968 --> 00:11:25,050
apni EMI ka table samajhna.

193
00:11:25,050 --> 00:11:28,987
Bhai ki kahani yaad karo. 50 lakh ka loan,

194
00:11:28,987 --> 00:11:32,923
aur bill lagbhag double. Par ab use pata hai,

195
00:11:32,923 --> 00:11:36,860
EMI sirf bharni nahi hoti, samajhni bhi padti hai.

196
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:41,437
Agle video mein ek aur bada sawaal. Ghar khareedna behtar hai,

197
00:11:41,437 --> 00:11:43,933
ya kiraye par rehkar paisa bachana?

198
00:11:43,933 --> 00:11:46,430
Jawaab shayad aapki soch badal de.

199
00:11:46,430 --> 00:11:51,013
Aur ab aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

200
00:11:51,013 --> 00:11:57,889
Aapka home loan floating rate par hai ya fixed?

201
00:11:57,889 --> 00:12:04,000
Comments mein likho, floating ya fixed. Main padhunga.
